# Example — real file is volumes/file-accounts/accounts.env (created by setup / dashboard).
# Shared by Samba (SMB) and SFTPGo (WebDAV). Password ≠ Authentik SSO.
#
# One line per user. Do NOT add UID_/GROUPS_ lines: unix uids must be unique
# per user inside the samba container (duplicates corrupt its passdb), so they
# are auto-assigned; file ownership is forced to PUID:PGID by the shares.
#
# ACCOUNT_alice=secret
